# InterviewPilot AI – Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------
# This file is for future versions that may integrate a real LLM.
# In v1 the app runs fully offline with rule-based question generation
# and keyword-based scoring. No API key is required.

# VITE_OPENAI_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Optional future settings
# VITE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# VITE_MAX_TOKENS=800
